        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Breeds: Mexican Hairless Dog, Chinese Crested Dog, Xoloitzcuintli, Xolo\n- Topics: Canine follicular dysplasia, alopecia\n\nFacts:\n- Canine follicular dysplasia includes breeds such as the Mexican Hairless Dog and Chinese Crested Dog that are specifically bred for alopecia.\n- The Mexican Hairless Dog is also called the Xoloitzcuintli, or Xolo for short.\n- The Xoloitzcuintli is a hairless dog breed.\n- The Xoloitzcuintli is found in toy, miniature, and standard sizes.",
